        "每个 step 开头 autoCompactIfNecessary：snapshot→shouldCompact→compact→memory.restore，再 buildPrompt（BaseAgentRuntime.java:200-202, 344-370）",
        "压缩抛异常只记日志、用未压缩 memory 继续——绝不让压缩失败中断 run（:364-369）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "三种实现",
      "items": [
        "LlmCompactPolicy：保留最近 N 条，旧对话交给模型产出 {goal,completed,pending,decisions,errors,testResults,openQuestions} 结构化摘要",
        "StructuredSummaryCompactPolicy：ContextProjector 按 ContextBudget 投影+机械拼接摘要；WindowedMemoryCompressor：只留尾部 maxItems 条"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "与 Coding 侧的关系",
      "items": [
        "CodingSessionCompactor 是会话级压缩（CodingAgent 外层），与本图的 step 内 CompactPolicy 是两层不同机制",
        "CompactPolicyMemoryCompressor 把策略包装成 MemoryCompressor，手动/外部触发也走同一 CompactResult"
